WEBVTT

00:00:18.084 --> 00:00:22.122
Though you are so close,
Kore hodo soba ni

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:26.626
I cannot tell you how I feel.
Iru no ni tsutaerarezu

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:30.697
The more strongly I feel,
Tsuyoku omou hodo

00:00:30.697 --> 00:00:35.301
the harder it is for me to find the words.
Kotoba ga mitsukaranai

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:43.343
What is sad is not fate...
Kanashii no wa unmei ja nakute

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:54.117
...but that all encounters come to an end.
Deai no subete ni owari ga aru koto

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:58.558
O incomplete beings,
Mikan naru mono

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:02.996
awaken, for beyond the night...
mezameyo yoru o koetara

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:07.067
At the end of the desert...
Sabaku no hate ni

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:14.735
...the truth surely awaits you.
Shinjitsu ga matteru yo kitto

00:01:44.671 --> 00:01:44.938
Dear!

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:45.768
Damn it!
Dear!

00:01:45.939 --> 00:01:47.668
No! Let me go!

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:49.935
Please stop!

00:01:50.310 --> 00:01:53.074
Dear! Dear!

00:02:08.661 --> 00:02:13.530
Desert Town

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:24.408
What's wrong?

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:25.034
Huh?

00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:27.970
I'd like it if you'd concentrate on your job.

00:02:28.114 --> 00:02:29.581
Oh, s-s-sorry.

00:02:39.659 --> 00:02:41.752
Just what the hell are they talking about?!

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:42.624
Joey!

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:44.060
Yeah, yeah!

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:45.862
Well, this is it.

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:47.757
Yes.

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:51.464
I know it was kind of hectic with
everything. Sorry about that.

00:02:51.771 --> 00:02:52.499
Not at all.

00:02:52.972 --> 00:02:54.701
Thanks for this.

00:02:54.774 --> 00:02:56.401
Does it still hurt?

00:02:56.509 --> 00:02:59.239
No, not one bit! It's fine now!

00:03:00.213 --> 00:03:01.077
I see.

00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:03.645
Yeah, it's fine...

00:03:05.585 --> 00:03:06.517
You know...

00:03:06.953 --> 00:03:08.284
Thank you for your hospitality.

00:03:08.488 --> 00:03:09.079
What?

00:03:09.889 --> 00:03:10.523
Well, then.

00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:12.616
O-Okay... Bye.

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:24.128
Honoka.

00:03:24.837 --> 00:03:27.772
I know, go see Old Man Nor, right?

00:03:28.074 --> 00:03:31.840
Man, I hate dealing with
that dirty-minded doctor.

00:03:32.412 --> 00:03:34.744
Why don't you have Meilin examine you, too?

00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:36.941
I detect no abnormalities in my system.

00:03:37.183 --> 00:03:39.777
Therefore, a need for such
cannot be recognized.

00:03:40.086 --> 00:03:41.018
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:42.789 --> 00:03:46.092
Of the human settlements
that dot the Rokugo Desert,

00:03:46.092 --> 00:03:50.859
Emporium Town is one of
the relatively large cities.

00:03:52.332 --> 00:03:54.234
Many of the towns on the frontier...

00:03:54.234 --> 00:03:58.170
...grow food in the bioplants
provided by The Third,

00:03:58.438 --> 00:04:01.134
establishing a system of self-sufficiency.

00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:05.044
Emporium is no different,

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:07.811
but what sets this town apart from the others...

00:04:08.081 --> 00:04:13.246
...is that it is full of Technos,
technicians of mechanical things.

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:17.923
Man could not survive without
mechanical civilization.

00:04:18.891 --> 00:04:23.521
And much of that was bestowed
upon them by The Third.

00:04:24.264 --> 00:04:27.427
However, though the technological
level was far inferior,

00:04:27.867 --> 00:04:31.428
there were some technologies that
people had developed independently.

00:04:34.240 --> 00:04:36.174
Hey, if it isn't Honoka!

00:04:36.542 --> 00:04:37.133
Hey.

00:04:37.577 --> 00:04:38.305
How about it?

00:04:38.544 --> 00:04:41.445
I've got a lot of things in
stock that you might like.

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:43.509
Thanks. I'll drop by later.

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:48.143
Man, I can just feel my urge to shop rising!

00:04:48.221 --> 00:04:50.781
Even though you just bought the PSP?

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.790
Yeah, yeah, I know.

00:04:52.859 --> 00:04:54.486
Yo, Sword Dancer.

00:04:55.695 --> 00:04:56.423
Kevin.

00:04:56.496 --> 00:04:59.932
Looking decidedly unfeminine as ever, I see.

00:05:00.066 --> 00:05:00.998
Leave it.

00:05:01.067 --> 00:05:02.557
Where's your sword?

00:05:02.902 --> 00:05:03.994
There was this little thing.

00:05:07.674 --> 00:05:08.504
You screw up?

00:05:08.574 --> 00:05:10.043
None of your business.

00:05:10.043 --> 00:05:11.635
Well, I'm in a hurry.

00:05:12.378 --> 00:05:13.208
Be careful.

00:05:14.814 --> 00:05:16.509
Blue Breaker's on the move.

00:05:17.617 --> 00:05:20.051
Word is, he's taken out a
couple people in the area.

00:05:21.788 --> 00:05:26.122
Well, not that you're one to die,
even if you get killed.

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:28.088
Later.

00:05:29.429 --> 00:05:30.555
You, too.

00:05:31.798 --> 00:05:34.323
Chris, here is your medicine.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.368
Please be sure to take it morning and night.

00:05:36.869 --> 00:05:38.496
Toshizo, these are for you.

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:41.834
I've also included some sedatives
to help you sleep well.

00:05:42.475 --> 00:05:43.407
Bato?

00:05:44.043 --> 00:05:45.169
Where did Bato...

00:05:45.611 --> 00:05:46.270
Oh!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.179
Welcome, Honoka!

00:05:53.653 --> 00:05:56.121
H-H-Hello, Meilin.

00:05:59.892 --> 00:06:01.154
Long time no see.

00:06:01.728 --> 00:06:04.026
You should've brought the
little boy with you, too.

00:06:04.330 --> 00:06:05.422
How is he?

00:06:05.498 --> 00:06:08.058
The little boy... Oh, Bogie.

00:06:08.201 --> 00:06:10.863
I invited him along, but he didn't
seem interested in coming.

00:06:13.106 --> 00:06:14.733
There's nothing wrong with the bones...

00:06:14.874 --> 00:06:16.865
...and no noticeable tears in the muscles, either.

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.112
Well, this isn't really the place for this,

00:06:19.112 --> 00:06:20.773
so go on in to the examination room.

00:06:20.947 --> 00:06:22.812
Do I really have to go in?

00:06:23.116 --> 00:06:24.708
But I already notified him.

00:06:24.884 --> 00:06:25.646
What?!

00:06:25.785 --> 00:06:28.583
To outpatient Honoka. To outpatient Honoka.

00:06:28.688 --> 00:06:31.057
Everything is ready for your
breast enlargement operation.

00:06:31.057 --> 00:06:34.151
Please come to Examination Room #2
on the 3rd floor immediately.

00:06:34.227 --> 00:06:37.628
Repeating. Everything is ready for
your breast enlargement operation.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:38.287
See?

00:06:38.898 --> 00:06:40.388
That old fossil!

00:06:41.434 --> 00:06:42.423
Make yourself at home!

00:06:43.069 --> 00:06:45.435
Breast enlargement operation, my ass!

00:06:45.538 --> 00:06:47.073
You don't want boobs?

00:06:47.073 --> 00:06:47.273
The hell I do!
You don't want boobs?

00:06:47.273 --> 00:06:48.240
The hell I do!

00:06:48.307 --> 00:06:49.774
There, cool down.

00:06:51.411 --> 00:06:53.208
Take a look at Meilin.

00:06:53.279 --> 00:06:55.008
Don't you think she looks good?

00:06:55.148 --> 00:06:56.945
Now, that's a man's dream.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.641
Meilin's an android!

00:06:59.919 --> 00:07:01.910
Dreams don't distinguish
between humans and machines.

00:07:01.988 --> 00:07:04.252
Those aren't called dreams!

00:07:04.424 --> 00:07:05.288
Oh-ho.

00:07:05.425 --> 00:07:08.795
Perhaps for a little girl not
a quarter century into life,

00:07:08.795 --> 00:07:11.025
it's too difficult a concept to grasp.

00:07:11.864 --> 00:07:14.162
Come on, quit standing and take a seat.

00:07:15.902 --> 00:07:17.529
It's always like this.

00:07:18.671 --> 00:07:21.936
Your outfit is as unfeminine as ever.

00:07:22.074 --> 00:07:24.277
Why don't you try dressing up once in a while...

00:07:24.277 --> 00:07:26.438
...in something frilly and poofy.

00:07:26.546 --> 00:07:28.343
You people, you're all the same!

00:07:28.514 --> 00:07:31.278
Like hell I could walk around
the desert dressed like that!

00:07:31.617 --> 00:07:34.643
It's called being service oriented. Being playful.

00:07:34.787 --> 00:07:36.914
It is, in other words, emotional latitude.

00:07:37.023 --> 00:07:40.618
Without fluctuations, a system
grows rigid and decrepit.

00:07:40.893 --> 00:07:44.226
Well, basically, it means
you'll become an old hag.

00:07:44.797 --> 00:07:46.924
Come on, hurry up and show me that arm.

00:07:47.066 --> 00:07:47.998
Yeah, yeah.

00:07:48.601 --> 00:07:51.365
Huh. Did you do this yourself?

00:07:51.437 --> 00:07:52.904
Well, yeah...

00:07:53.072 --> 00:07:56.439
Liar. As if it would turn out this neat.

00:08:01.314 --> 00:08:02.576
What did you take a swing at?

00:08:03.149 --> 00:08:04.173
A Type-4.

00:08:04.383 --> 00:08:06.351
Talk about a waste of time.

00:08:06.519 --> 00:08:07.713
Was it Joganki?

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:08.818
Pretty much.

00:08:08.888 --> 00:08:11.448
I've told you not to get involved with him.

00:08:11.524 --> 00:08:13.515
It's not like I want to be.

00:08:14.627 --> 00:08:15.719
When did it happen?

00:08:16.295 --> 00:08:17.284
Two days ago.

00:08:17.964 --> 00:08:20.558
Can I link up with Bogie's medical data?

00:08:22.535 --> 00:08:26.266
Bogie, open up port 124875.

00:08:27.373 --> 00:08:29.170
But well...

00:08:29.308 --> 00:08:30.206
What?

00:08:30.843 --> 00:08:33.012
If you're getting beat up fighting Type-4s,

00:08:33.012 --> 00:08:36.038
maybe it's time you gave up the sword.

00:08:36.315 --> 00:08:38.943
It was a new model and
its armor was kind of hard.

00:08:39.252 --> 00:08:41.482
Can a sword cut through a Type-4?!

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:46.256
Remember Walken's words.

00:08:46.359 --> 00:08:48.561
Quick-draw is a skill, a sword is...

00:08:48.561 --> 00:08:50.290
...merely an object.

00:08:50.396 --> 00:08:51.920
Exactly.

00:08:54.066 --> 00:08:55.897
Two days ago, you said?

00:08:56.135 --> 00:08:56.794
Yeah.

00:08:57.136 --> 00:08:59.502
Just tape and an anti-inflammatory?

00:08:59.572 --> 00:09:00.266
Yup.

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:02.967
That's strange.

00:09:05.444 --> 00:09:07.935
It's healing a bit too quickly.

00:09:08.748 --> 00:09:11.239
You really haven't done anything to it?

00:09:11.317 --> 00:09:11.976
Yeah.

00:09:13.586 --> 00:09:16.222
Ah-ha! It's a boy, isn't it?!

00:09:16.222 --> 00:09:16.984
What?!

00:09:17.256 --> 00:09:20.191
I'd been thinking you were acting strange.

00:09:21.294 --> 00:09:22.461
It makes sense now!

00:09:22.461 --> 00:09:25.898
H-Hey, where the hell did you
draw that conclusion from?!

00:09:25.898 --> 00:09:27.832
Now, now, don't be so shy.

00:09:27.934 --> 00:09:31.392
So, spring has finally come for the sword girl.

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:33.097
Good, good.

00:09:33.172 --> 00:09:34.307
Cheers!

00:09:34.307 --> 00:09:35.535
Hey, now!

00:09:36.175 --> 00:09:38.643
That reminds me, speaking of strange,

00:09:38.811 --> 00:09:42.611
The Third's activities seem rather flurried.

00:09:43.683 --> 00:09:46.618
The Inspection Force seems to
be getting reinforcements, too.

00:09:46.686 --> 00:09:47.887
These past couple days,

00:09:47.887 --> 00:09:50.981
autonomous soldiers have been
scurrying around incessantly.

00:09:51.223 --> 00:09:51.917
A crackdown?

00:09:52.091 --> 00:09:54.685
No, that doesn't seem to be the case.

00:09:54.894 --> 00:09:57.530
The usual inspections are being carried out,

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.124
but they seem to be after something else.

00:10:03.536 --> 00:10:05.800
What could they be up to, I wonder.

00:10:06.472 --> 00:10:09.236
Well, your wrist isn't too serious.

00:10:09.308 --> 00:10:10.104
Whoops!

00:10:11.711 --> 00:10:14.339
I'll let Meilin know,
so get some medicine from her.

00:10:14.547 --> 00:10:16.378
That's all. Examination is over.

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:19.011
Go on, get outta here.

00:10:22.655 --> 00:10:25.249
Honoka was thinking back about Iks.

00:10:26.325 --> 00:10:28.418
The young man Joganki had come to meet.

00:10:29.261 --> 00:10:31.024
Why was he on her mind?

00:10:31.497 --> 00:10:34.193
Was she worried about him?

00:10:34.967 --> 00:10:36.798
Even Honoka could not say.

00:10:39.305 --> 00:10:40.203
Honoka.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:41.904
Meilin.

00:10:42.208 --> 00:10:44.073
Why don't you rest for a while longer?

00:10:45.077 --> 00:10:46.305
I got kicked out.

00:10:48.114 --> 00:10:49.376
Here's your medicine.

00:10:51.984 --> 00:10:52.973
All this?

00:10:53.152 --> 00:10:55.888
He figures you're heedlessly
running around out there anyway,

00:10:55.888 --> 00:10:57.549
so he told me to give you a full kit.

00:10:59.225 --> 00:11:02.251
This is cold medicine and
this is digestive medicine.

00:11:02.495 --> 00:11:05.589
And these blue pills are the anti-inflammatory.

00:11:05.998 --> 00:11:07.158
Oh, and also...

00:11:09.769 --> 00:11:10.701
What're those?

00:11:11.737 --> 00:11:13.261
Oral contraceptives.

00:11:13.439 --> 00:11:14.173
What?!

00:11:14.173 --> 00:11:16.733
The Doctor insisted that I give you some.

00:11:17.343 --> 00:11:20.540
I'd say... an hour before or after should do it.

00:11:21.113 --> 00:11:23.482
You're coming into womanhood,

00:11:23.482 --> 00:11:23.949
so you should be careful of such things.

00:11:23.949 --> 00:11:24.950
T-T-That old fossil!
So you should be careful of such things.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:28.215
T-T-That old fossil!

00:11:32.358 --> 00:11:33.325
Perfect!

00:11:33.559 --> 00:11:35.618
Bogie, anything unusual to report?

00:11:35.695 --> 00:11:36.684
Everything's normal.

00:11:36.862 --> 00:11:39.888
Okay. I just left Old Man Nor's place.

00:11:40.366 --> 00:11:42.201
We've got bills to pay,

00:11:42.201 --> 00:11:44.226
so I'm going to earn some loose
change before heading back.

00:11:44.336 --> 00:11:46.304
Blue Breaker's on the move.

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:48.702
You've got quick ears.

00:11:48.974 --> 00:11:51.169
It's not in me to just sit and wait.

00:11:51.544 --> 00:11:54.138
The Inspection Force also
seems to be behaving strangely.

00:11:54.613 --> 00:11:55.739
I heard about that, too.

00:11:56.182 --> 00:11:58.484
I can't intercept their communications,

00:11:58.484 --> 00:12:00.152
but putting all the information together,

00:12:00.152 --> 00:12:01.881
their purpose appears to be a search.

00:12:03.923 --> 00:12:06.392
This is speculation, but that Iks...

00:12:06.392 --> 00:12:06.726
Bogie.
This is speculation, but that Iks...

00:12:06.726 --> 00:12:07.192
Bogie.

00:12:08.127 --> 00:12:09.424
I'll be back by evening.

00:12:09.762 --> 00:12:10.353
Later.

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:11.560
Roger.

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:12.858
Be careful, Honoka.

00:12:13.165 --> 00:12:14.189
I know.

00:12:18.904 --> 00:12:21.065
Okay, time to work!

00:12:37.389 --> 00:12:40.085
Say, that guy earlier...

00:12:40.159 --> 00:12:43.595
If it's about Iks, neither Honoka
nor I know much about him.

00:12:43.996 --> 00:12:46.021
The circumstances are just as I told you.

00:12:49.201 --> 00:12:50.099
Joey!

00:12:50.269 --> 00:12:53.466
I know. But still...

00:12:55.674 --> 00:12:57.335
What's with that guy?

00:13:03.549 --> 00:13:06.074
Okay, gimme one more!

00:13:06.152 --> 00:13:07.949
Sorry for making you do this, Hono.

00:13:08.254 --> 00:13:10.848
No way! I'm a jack-of-all-trades, after all!

00:13:12.291 --> 00:13:13.986
Coming through! Coming through!

00:13:16.562 --> 00:13:18.462
I'll leave this right here.

00:13:18.564 --> 00:13:20.259
Hey, Honoka.

00:13:21.634 --> 00:13:23.124
What's this, Honoka?

00:13:23.736 --> 00:13:25.431
Did you give up your old
job to be a transporter?

00:13:25.504 --> 00:13:29.907
I made a big purchase,
so I gotta earn to make up for it.

00:13:30.276 --> 00:13:30.970
See you around.

00:13:31.343 --> 00:13:32.401
Good luck!

00:13:39.218 --> 00:13:41.345
Honoka loved this town.

00:13:42.488 --> 00:13:47.118
She loved interacting with the
people of this town through work.

00:13:48.227 --> 00:13:49.216
There we go.

00:13:49.929 --> 00:13:51.123
Cindy, what's next?

00:13:54.033 --> 00:13:55.022
Thanks for your hard work.

00:13:55.301 --> 00:13:56.393
Take a short break.

00:13:56.468 --> 00:13:58.436
But... Are you sure?

00:13:59.004 --> 00:14:00.130
I've got enough to sell.

00:14:00.439 --> 00:14:01.235
Okay.

00:14:04.476 --> 00:14:09.345
You know, it'd be a great help
if you'd come work for me.

00:14:09.615 --> 00:14:12.551
A pretty store girl attracts customers!

00:14:12.551 --> 00:14:14.542
You're more than enough!

00:14:14.687 --> 00:14:17.053
You desert diamond!

00:14:17.122 --> 00:14:18.214
Oh, you!

00:14:24.330 --> 00:14:25.297
That place...

00:14:25.364 --> 00:14:26.991
What? Oh...

00:14:27.132 --> 00:14:28.565
There was a raid the other day.

00:14:31.971 --> 00:14:35.600
He had a wife and a baby, didn't he?

00:14:35.941 --> 00:14:37.169
They left town.

00:14:37.743 --> 00:14:39.506
Said they'd look for some
other way to make a living.

00:14:42.481 --> 00:14:43.880
The Technos Taboo.

00:14:44.984 --> 00:14:48.750
People are only allowed a
limited degree of technology...

00:14:49.054 --> 00:14:54.185
...and The Third come down hard on
those who infringe upon that law.

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:58.093
You wouldn't have been able to do
anything, even if you were here.

00:14:58.364 --> 00:15:00.889
I couldn't do anything for them, either.

00:15:00.966 --> 00:15:03.628
That's true, but...

00:15:03.702 --> 00:15:06.466
Don't worry. I'm sure they're doing fine.

00:15:07.006 --> 00:15:09.065
They'll send back some news in time.

00:15:10.242 --> 00:15:11.436
Excuse me.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:12.807
Oh, welcome!

00:15:14.179 --> 00:15:16.113
I guess that's all there is to it...

00:15:16.982 --> 00:15:21.009
A jack-of-all-trades, who could do
nothing... nothing for them.

00:15:22.221 --> 00:15:25.713
She, too, had no choice but to live in this world.

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:37.796
Wow, that's great!

00:15:40.973 --> 00:15:41.997
Iks...

00:15:44.576 --> 00:15:46.441
What is the matter, Miss Honoka?

00:15:46.545 --> 00:15:48.479
You might be a wanted man!

00:15:48.580 --> 00:15:50.514
What're you doing playing
around like nothing's wrong?!

00:15:50.649 --> 00:15:51.775
What are you talking about?

00:15:51.884 --> 00:15:52.714
Nevermind!

00:15:52.785 --> 00:15:53.410
Miss Honoka...

00:16:01.593 --> 00:16:03.686
Word is, Myer got nabbed, too.

00:16:03.796 --> 00:16:06.060
Says he'll close up shop and move out of town.

00:16:06.131 --> 00:16:07.633
Even if he moves out,

00:16:07.633 --> 00:16:11.296
he'll just end up dead in the
desert or fall prey to wanderers.

00:16:11.837 --> 00:16:15.603
All we do is make tools a little more useful.

00:16:16.108 --> 00:16:20.511
The Third don't care a thing about us.

00:16:23.182 --> 00:16:25.480
Well, talk about rare!

00:16:25.851 --> 00:16:27.152
You in the company of a man!

00:16:27.152 --> 00:16:27.709
Shut up!

00:16:29.121 --> 00:16:30.986
Who is that guy?

00:16:35.327 --> 00:16:36.055
Who is he?

00:16:36.228 --> 00:16:36.956
Kevin.

00:16:37.396 --> 00:16:39.193
Is he also a jack-of-all-trades?

00:16:39.598 --> 00:16:41.793
No, he's a mercenary.

00:16:42.801 --> 00:16:45.099
Hey, that's not what we're here to talk about!

00:16:45.504 --> 00:16:46.994
Is there some trouble?

00:16:47.206 --> 00:16:48.332
Look here!

00:16:55.180 --> 00:16:57.307
In surviving in this harsh land,

00:16:57.649 --> 00:17:00.880
everybody has a scar or two from their struggles.

00:17:02.488 --> 00:17:05.753
Some may resort to actions that run
counter to their morals at times.

00:17:07.059 --> 00:17:10.426
The reason he or she may have had to do so...

00:17:10.829 --> 00:17:13.559
...is not something another
can ever truly understand.

00:17:14.033 --> 00:17:16.797
Nor is there a need for such understanding.

00:17:17.669 --> 00:17:21.662
That was the unspoken rule among
those living on the frontier.

00:17:25.411 --> 00:17:27.845
You are an interesting person, Miss Honoka.

00:17:29.048 --> 00:17:31.450
Even after we parted this morning,

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:33.645
I kept thinking about you.

00:17:33.819 --> 00:17:34.615
What?

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:37.184
I really enjoy being with you.

00:17:37.289 --> 00:17:40.122
Huh? Uh, what are you saying?

00:17:40.459 --> 00:17:43.326
It is the truth. This is not flattery.

00:17:43.729 --> 00:17:44.753
You are...

00:17:45.264 --> 00:17:46.398
How should I put this?

00:17:46.398 --> 00:17:47.626
You are special.

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:50.269
More so than anyone or any life...

00:17:50.269 --> 00:17:52.965
...I have encountered since coming here.

00:17:54.606 --> 00:17:55.903
Any life?

00:17:55.974 --> 00:17:56.599
Yes.

00:17:57.009 --> 00:17:58.169
Say, Iks...

00:18:00.879 --> 00:18:02.210
What're you here for?!

00:18:12.791 --> 00:18:15.089
We would like for you to come with us.

00:18:15.661 --> 00:18:16.650
Where to?

00:18:17.129 --> 00:18:19.495
First, to the local air force base.

00:18:19.565 --> 00:18:22.329
After that, we shall take you to Hyperius by air.

00:18:22.501 --> 00:18:25.299
Unfortunately, I am not interested right now.

00:18:25.604 --> 00:18:26.901
Please convey my regrets.

00:18:27.206 --> 00:18:29.265
Our orders are to bring you in.

00:18:29.842 --> 00:18:31.707
What will you do if I say no?

00:18:35.614 --> 00:18:38.082
Those who interfere will be eliminated.

00:18:38.317 --> 00:18:41.047
I don't like coercive tactics.

00:18:42.454 --> 00:18:43.648
Take that!

00:18:44.022 --> 00:18:45.489
I'm so drunk!

00:18:47.292 --> 00:18:48.122
Kevin!

00:18:48.794 --> 00:18:49.954
All right!

00:18:52.698 --> 00:18:54.066
Let's party!

00:18:54.066 --> 00:18:57.001
Hey, sounds good! It's been 2 weeks!

00:18:58.804 --> 00:19:00.669
Go on, Sword Dancer.

00:19:01.073 --> 00:19:02.301
Thanks, man!

00:19:06.145 --> 00:19:07.874
Don't get too carried away now!

00:19:08.914 --> 00:19:09.972
Whoa...

00:19:16.889 --> 00:19:19.653
Well, this time for sure, this is it...

00:19:19.925 --> 00:19:21.790
Where will you be going now, Miss Honoka?

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:25.227
Me? I'm headed back to Zankan.

00:19:25.397 --> 00:19:27.797
I have to go pick up that thing.

00:19:29.701 --> 00:19:31.430
Well, so I guess that's it.

00:19:31.703 --> 00:19:33.068
Oh, Miss Honoka.

00:19:33.906 --> 00:19:34.497
Huh?

00:19:35.307 --> 00:19:37.502
I would like to hire you for a job.

00:19:37.876 --> 00:19:38.535
What?!

00:19:39.077 --> 00:19:42.843
Huh? Um, well, okay, but...

00:19:43.148 --> 00:19:44.115
What kind of job?

00:19:44.416 --> 00:19:47.783
Would this be acceptable as payment?

00:19:48.420 --> 00:19:50.820
Whoa, Tzaer gold pieces!

00:19:50.923 --> 00:19:54.950
Miss Honoka, won't you
please take me with you?

00:19:55.027 --> 00:19:58.019
What? So, you have some
business with Zankan, too?

00:19:58.497 --> 00:20:02.866
No, I would like to accompany
you on your journey.

00:20:02.968 --> 00:20:03.696
What?!

00:20:03.969 --> 00:20:04.560
Wha?!

00:20:06.738 --> 00:20:08.069
But, why?

00:20:08.373 --> 00:20:10.307
I cannot explain it to you in detail, but...

00:20:10.909 --> 00:20:16.006
I would just like to see the many
things that I do not know about.

00:20:16.081 --> 00:20:16.740
Huh?

00:20:18.483 --> 00:20:19.780
And I would like to learn...

00:20:20.185 --> 00:20:21.311
About this world.

00:20:21.687 --> 00:20:24.850
About the many beings that live on this world.

00:20:25.691 --> 00:20:27.158
This world...

00:20:28.794 --> 00:20:33.925
I cannot think of a better person
to be my escort and my guide.

00:20:34.399 --> 00:20:35.195
So...

00:20:35.367 --> 00:20:36.493
Well...

00:20:36.602 --> 00:20:38.832
I don't think there's any reason to refuse.

00:20:39.104 --> 00:20:39.695
Bogie?

00:20:39.938 --> 00:20:44.773
Currently, our unit is in extremely
tough financial straits.

00:20:45.110 --> 00:20:48.947
The reason being the armor
piercing rifle that you purchased,

00:20:48.947 --> 00:20:50.849
as well as various other
weapons and munitions...

00:20:50.849 --> 00:20:53.943
Okay, I get it, I get it! Yes, you're right!

00:20:56.121 --> 00:20:58.419
Yeah. We need the money.

00:20:58.523 --> 00:20:59.649
Besides, well,

00:20:59.925 --> 00:21:03.793
I have a feeling you'd get into
trouble if I left you on your own.

00:21:04.029 --> 00:21:04.757
Then...

00:21:04.896 --> 00:21:08.354
Okay, I accept your job.

00:21:09.301 --> 00:21:10.495
Thank you very much.

00:21:13.472 --> 00:21:14.598
For real?

00:21:29.221 --> 00:21:31.985
Honoka had lied just a little bit.

00:21:32.891 --> 00:21:36.759
The truth was, she was happy
to be able to be with him.

00:21:37.963 --> 00:21:41.592
But she did not say so.

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:48.006
A flexible civilization...
Juunan na bunmei wa

00:21:48.006 --> 00:21:50.509
...is always rapidly advancing.
Itsudatte nisshin-geppo

00:21:50.509 --> 00:21:53.478
You and your dreams are also...
Kimi to yume mo

00:21:53.478 --> 00:21:57.278
...making headway even now.
Genzai shinkou

00:22:02.788 --> 00:22:05.757
I realized for the first time...
Hajimete kizuitan da

00:22:05.757 --> 00:22:09.454
...with that line, resembling a surprise attack.
Fui-uchi ni nita sono serifu de

00:22:14.499 --> 00:22:17.436
My sixth sense was pried open.
Kojiakerareta dai-rokkan

00:22:17.436 --> 00:22:21.463
I'd been waiting for this feeling this whole time.
Kono kankaku o zutto matteita

00:22:25.477 --> 00:22:28.447
Opening my heart, just opening it...
Kokoro o hiraite tada hiraite

00:22:28.447 --> 00:22:31.416
I embrace the voices of strangers.
Daisansha no koe ukeireru

00:22:31.416 --> 00:22:34.286
Earnestly persevering, just persevering...
Hitasura koraete tada koraete

00:22:34.286 --> 00:22:37.380
I even try turning pages of criticism.
Hinan no peeji mo aketemiru

00:22:37.689 --> 00:22:40.659
I'm going to leave my...
Toushindai no boku wa

00:22:40.659 --> 00:22:43.595
...true-to-life self behind, right here.
Koko ni oite iku yo

00:22:43.595 --> 00:22:47.432
You can say whatever you want now...
Mou nanto itte kuretemo

00:22:47.432 --> 00:22:48.956
...and I'm fine with that.
Kekkou da

00:22:49.468 --> 00:22:54.940
Ah, how simple is the impulse to evolve.
Aa nante tanjun da shinka shitai to iu shoudou

00:22:54.940 --> 00:22:57.843
You and your dreams are also...
Kimi to yume mo

00:22:57.843 --> 00:23:01.040
...making headway even now.
Genzai shinkou

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:16.889
Preview

00:23:17.696 --> 00:23:20.198
Having decided to travel with Iks,

00:23:20.198 --> 00:23:23.690
I headed off to see the old man
to get my completed PSP.

00:23:24.136 --> 00:23:27.128
I never expected such an event
to be awaiting me there.

00:23:27.472 --> 00:23:29.838
I didn't even have an inkling at that time.

00:23:30.842 --> 00:23:32.833
If only I had acted sooner...

00:23:33.578 --> 00:23:36.672
Blue Breaker, I'll never forgive you!

00:23:37.449 --> 00:23:40.748
Next time on
The Third - The Girl With The Blue Eye,

00:23:40.919 --> 00:23:42.053
episode 4, "Blue Breaker".

00:23:42.053 --> 00:23:43.488
Blue Breaker
episode 4, "Blue Breaker".

00:23:43.488 --> 00:23:44.921
Blue Breaker
